            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>An example of an agitator (18) for a vacuum cleaner (10) may include a body (40) and at least one deformable flap (2802) extending from the body (40). The deformable flap (2802) may include at least one taper. The at least one taper causes a cleaning edge of the deformable flap (2802) to approach the body (40).</p>
